<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 700)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Compare pairs you can see at a glance.</b> Every pair in the playlist now has its own color: both rows are tinted with it, both thumbnails are framed in it and badged A and B, and a rail in that color runs down the left edge from one clip to the other &#8212; past any clips in between. The web playlist uses the same colors.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
